{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：X 的部分音乐术语和比喻，如“变成F小调”“马祖卡味”，对普通观众不够直观；个别感受描述也稍显堆叠，Y 的日常情绪语言反而更容易直接理解。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X 用加亮的关键词让人迅速抓住每段叙事的核心，不必读完长句才能知道发生了什么；感受文字分层并在音乐相应位置出现，也减少了一次性面对大量短词的负担。更重要的是，X 把音乐中的音色、节奏、身体感受与人物心理变化联系起来，让人不仅知道他在想什么，还能理解他为什么反复动摇，以及这些动摇如何一步步走向最后的自我接纳。Y 的叙事其实也清楚，但感受词更多像并列的情绪注释，音乐变化与人物经历之间的对应关系没有 X 那么鲜明。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "f611b680-8246-4f8e-82b9-3882fe807574", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T173042431236Z", "elapsed_seconds": 48.031, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T17:31:30.468249+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "01b3f5acb29e776d2d3d02694a92c04a1844543c50087220390c24a0209a42a3", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4